      "body": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "heading": "The idea",
          "text": "The Tower is a menu with a skybox. Everyone lands, opens three vendors, and leaves inside ninety seconds.\n\nGive the space things that only work when other people are in it, and the ninety seconds becomes a reason to stay."
